'''Season twenty-two''' of ''[[Dancing with the Stars (American TV series)|Dancing with the Stars]]'' premiered March 21, 2016, on the ABC network.<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.people.com/article/dancing-stars-season-22-premiere-date|title=Dancing with the Stars Season 22 Premiere Date Revealed!|last=Gomez|first=Patrick|work=[[People Magazine]]|date=November 24, 2015|access-date=March 14, 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160315130008/http://www.people.com/article/dancing-stars-season-22-premiere-date|archive-date=March 15, 2016|url-status=live}}</ref>

On May 24, model [[Nyle DiMarco]] and [[Peta Murgatroyd]] were crowned champions, while [[Ultimate Fighting Championship|UFC]] fighter [[Paige VanZant]] and [[Mark Ballas]] finished in second place, and ''[[Good Morning America]]'' meteorologist [[Ginger Zee]] and [[Valentin Chmerkovskiy]] finished third.

==Cast==

===Couples===
This season featured twelve celebrity contestants. [[Edyta Śliwińska]] returned as a professional dancer after an eleven-season hiatus.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.etonline.com/news/183653_edyta_sliwinska_returning_for_dancing_with_the_stars_season_22/|title=EXCLUSIVE: Edyta Sliwinska Returning for 'Dancing With the Stars' Season 22|work=Entertainment Tonight|access-date=3 March 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160303015321/http://www.etonline.com/news/183653_edyta_sliwinska_returning_for_dancing_with_the_stars_season_22/|archive-date=3 March 2016|url-status=live}}</ref> Also returning to the pro roster were [[Artem Chigvintsev]], [[Peta Murgatroyd]], and [[Sasha Farber]]. Actress [[Jodie Sweetin]] was the first celebrity revealed on ''[[Good Morning America]]'' on March 2, 2016, while TV meteorologist [[Ginger Zee]] was also revealed on that show two days later.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7qixPB17id0|title=Jodie Sweetin 1st Cast Reveal DWTS Season 22 – GMA|work=Youtube|date=March 2, 2016|access-date=March 2, 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160304154155/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7qixPB17id0|archive-date=March 4, 2016|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.people.com/article/dancing-with-the-stars-ginger-zee-joins-partner-val-chmerkovskiy?xid=socialflow_twitter_peoplemag|title=New Mom Ginger Zee Joins ''Dancing with the Stars'' with Val Chmerkovskiy!|work=[[People (magazine)|People]]|author=Corinthios, Aurelie|date=March 4, 2016|access-date=March 10, 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160311011143/http://www.people.com/article/dancing-with-the-stars-ginger-zee-joins-partner-val-chmerkovskiy?xid=socialflow_twitter_peoplemag|archive-date=March 11, 2016|url-status=live}}</ref> The remaining celebrities and professionals dancers were later revealed, also on ''Good Morning America'', on March 8.<ref name="GMA">{{cite web |date=March 8, 2016 |title=''Dancing With the Stars'' 2016: Season 22 Celebrity Cast Revealed Live on 'GMA' |url=https://abcnews.go.com/Entertainment/dancing-stars-2016-season-22-celebrity-cast-revealed/story?id=37472389 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160308235239/https://abcnews.go.com/Entertainment/dancing-stars-2016-season-22-celebrity-cast-revealed/story?id=37472389 |archive-date=March 8, 2016 |access-date=March 8, 2016 |work=ABC News}}</ref>

